  "ruleText": "Plc 805.09 Challenging a Denial of Registration Renewal. An applicant who wishes to challenge the denial of an application for registration renewal shall do so as provided in Plc 308.12.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 800) #13885 eff 4-15-24",
